</style></head><body><main id="washroom-finder"><header><a class="home" href="/">nosa.dev</a><h1>U of R washroom finder</h1><p class="intro">Find a comfortable stall along your campus day.</p></header>
<p><strong>ED 544 has a firsthand report of comfortable space.</strong> RI 443 is the similar-layout alternative to test.</p>
<details class="calendar-import"><summary>Use your calendar (optional)</summary>
<p>Import a campus calendar JSON export to filter buildings by day. The file is read and stored in this browser; it is not uploaded. This public page includes no personal calendar.</p>
<div class="import-controls"><label>Calendar JSON file<input id="wf-import" type="file" accept=".json,application/json"></label><button id="wf-clear-calendar" type="button">Remove local calendar</button></div>
<p id="wf-import-status" class="small" aria-live="polite"></p>
</details><div class="controls">
<label class="field">Date<input id="wf-date" type="date" min="2026-09-01" max="2027-04-30" value="2026-10-23"></label>
<label class="field">Start of a 15-minute visit<input id="wf-time" type="time" value="14:01"></label>
<label class="field">Building<select id="wf-building" aria-describedby="wf-building-note"></select></label>
</div>
<div class="toggles" aria-label="Washroom filters">
<label class="toggle"><input id="wf-only-day" type="checkbox" role="switch"><span>Only buildings on this day</span></label>
<label class="toggle"><input id="wf-ieee" type="checkbox" role="switch" checked><span>Include IEEE lounge (ED)</span></label>
<label class="toggle"><input id="wf-private" type="checkbox" role="switch"><span>Include private washrooms</span></label>
</div>
<p id="wf-building-note" class="small"></p>
<div id="wf-status" class="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
<div id="wf-results" aria-live="polite"></div>
<p class="small">“Changes” counts whole-floor class starts/ends from 10 minutes before the visit to 10 minutes after it ends. Zero does not mean an empty washroom. * includes possible multi-room assignments.</p>
<details><summary>Your campus calendar that day</summary><div id="wf-events"></div></details>
<details><summary>Details and floor plans for these results</summary><div id="wf-details"></div></details>
<details><summary>Research coverage and limits</summary><div class="guide"><p>Research snapshot: 16 October 2026. Covers Fall 2026 and Winter 2027 credit-class schedules. All 3,179 Fall and 3,224 Winter catalogue sections matched VSB. The original model retained 6,585 section records and 9,587 meeting patterns; this page includes the 805 patterns relevant to the listed washroom floors.</p><p>Twenty-four Fall non-credit listings exposed no room/time information and could not be mapped. Staff, research, informal study, clinics, cleaning and many events are uncounted. Multiple possible room assignments are retained as possibilities. Counts are floor-wide starts and ends, not people or washroom occupancy.</p><p>ED 544 has a firsthand comfort report. Other stall dimensions, cleanliness and access have not been inspected. Luther and Campion have no verified matching stall in this research. Access and schedules can change; this snapshot does not refresh automatically.</p><p><a href="https://www.uregina.ca/about/contact/maps-directions/all-gender-washrooms.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Official accessible/all-gender directory</a> &middot; <a href="https://www.uregina.ca/registrar/academic-calendars-and-schedule/academic-schedule.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Academic schedule</a></p></div></details><p class="small">Class timetable snapshot: 16 October 2026 · <a href="https://www.uregina.ca/about/contact/maps-directions/buildings.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Official floor plans</a> · <a href="https://vsb.uregina.ca/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">VSB</a></p>
</main><script is:inline>
